      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778733097968,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> so here an Array inside another array will be there \n\n> But in java the reference variable will take \n    4 Bytes of memory \n    sometimse it will be 8 Bytes also\n\n> first an array of size 3 will be created for storing\n   the memory location references\n\n> then three Independent Arrays will be created to store \n  3 values in each Array",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> so here an Array inside another array will be there \n\n> But in java the reference variable will take \n    4 Bytes of memory \n    sometimse it will be 8 Bytes also\n\n> first an array of size 3 will be created for storing\n   the memory location references\n\n> then three Independent Arrays will be created to store \n  3 values in each Array",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
