      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778733097968,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> So whenever we access the arr[0]  --> 3004 (address) will come \n> in that location an other array was there and \n\narr[0][1]  --> 3004 [1]",
