      "text": "So here we are using the  new keyword so the memory will be allocated\nin Heap memory",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So here we are using the  new keyword so the memory will be allocated\nin Heap memory",
