      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "> Array having some meta data in that that is length\n\n> Array internally extending Object class so that all the methods of \n  Object  class like\n\n                        .hashCode()\n              boolean .equals(Object obj)\n              String   .toString()\n    \n    All these methods we can directly use on the Arrays",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "> Array having some meta data in that that is length\n\n> Array internally extending Object class so that all the methods of \n  Object  class like\n\n                        .hashCode()\n              boolean .equals(Object obj)\n              String   .toString()\n    \n    All these methods we can directly use on the Arrays",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
